{"id": "Dcd4ag1PHIx", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"PLUGIN\" to get these 3 AI scrapers. \n\nThese 3 Claude plugins let you scrape anything off the internet without paying for anything.\n\nFirst is ScrapegraphAI.\n\nIt lets you scrape any website using a simple text prompt.\n\nYou just tell it what you want.\n\nIt comes back with clean, structured data instantly.\n\nThen there is Agent Reach.\n\nIt takes it a step further and lets you scrape even gated platforms.\n\nLike LinkedIn, Instagram, X, and Reddit.\n\nWith no API key required.\n\nAnd finally there's Scrapling MCP.\n\nIt has already crossed over 70,000 stars on GitHub.\n\nIt automatically adapts whenever a site changes its layout.\n\nSo your setup keeps working instead of breaking every few weeks.\n\nTogether, these three cover almost every scraping situation you'll ever run into.\n\nSimple sites, gated platforms, and sites that constantly change their structure.\n\nNo more paying for scraping APIs or maintaining broken scripts every month.\n\n#Agentreach #Scrapegraph #Scrapling #webscraping #aiscrap ", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1787669193, "like_count": 3879, "comment_count": 4844, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1045130904970159a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 65.226, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-5.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOvQzZ9M-TxOrJBVwvBLIFtA08l0nBUy7NCm9qlZyVA56M7BaZAirDUIlw4JHxzPxeJDevmGMEV56UrurjKXs87Xjo7cL1yJA4vwtI.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc=AdpwfTgMX3SUfF64Cr4PsQxaOG6G0QnvMffxW815WzlajPHT3pADvATYKxIZuylJupI&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-5.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=VtS-edxMMCoQ7kNvwHrgaBy&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=099g4fDcHF0JhsCRW_7WpQ&_nc_ss=70a8c&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQTSQ1j5eOc5pRw88YhO0KsAjfhZuehuQtPYNcw9_KrwtA&o